  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The outcome assessment will cover partner agribusinesses and smallholder farmers engaged through the CASA component for both Cohort I and Cohort II. The research will adopt a mixed research approach, consisting of a quantitative survey of smallholder farmers and qualitative enquiry with farmers, partners and potentially other stakeholders.</narrative>
